  "_comment": "Reference for the Bubblewrap project (which lives in its OWN repo, see PROJECT_HANDOVER/21_ANDROID_APP.md §4). After `bubblewrap init --manifest https://app.roamhub360.com/manifest.webmanifest` compare the generated twa-manifest.json with this file and align the values; fill the two <PLACEHOLDER>s. Do not commit the keystore or its passwords anywhere.",
